{"id":"n75795-3-8","stage":5,"title":"정복 · 征服","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75795-3-8-1","ko":"이번에는 꼭 영어 회화 정복을 하고 말거야.","zh":"这次我一定要攻克英语会话的！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번에는","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꼭","meaning":"一定，必定","explanation":"꼭：一定，必定","readings":[{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48064","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영어","meaning":"英语","explanation":"영어：英语","readings":[{"term":"영어","audio":"/audio/9a37f8fdb58ccaa0bb5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28241","senseId":"1","lemma":"영어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회화","meaning":"会话","explanation":"회화：会话","readings":[{"term":"회화","audio":"/audio/f3ffa96aa960610dfe77.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90605","senseId":"2","lemma":"회화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정복을","meaning":"征服，攻克","explanation":"정복：征服，攻克；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"정복","audio":"/audio/305e745bc7bbad8fb312.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75795","senseId":"3","lemma":"정복","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하고","meaning":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。","explanation":"하다：表示两个以上的并列或反复。；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"26","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말거야.","meaning":"结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）；表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"말다：结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）；거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"},{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72580","senseId":"3","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"712da780b7ecf8b7","term":"꼭","zh":"一定，必定","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3","entryId":"48064","definition":"无论有什么事情也务必。","pronunciation":["꼭"]},{"id":"9a37f8fdb58ccaa0","term":"영어","zh":"英语","audio":"/audio/9a37f8fdb58ccaa0bb5f.mp3","entryId":"28241","definition":"英国和美国等国家使用的世界上使用范围最广的语言。","pronunciation":["영어"]},{"id":"f3ffa96aa960610d","term":"회화","zh":"会话","audio":"/audio/f3ffa96aa960610dfe77.mp3","entryId":"90605","definition":"用外语交谈；或指这种谈话。","pronunciation":["회ː화","훼ː화"]},{"id":"305e745bc7bbad8f","term":"정복","zh":"征服，攻克","audio":"/audio/305e745bc7bbad8fb312.mp3","entryId":"75795","definition":"如愿完成了很难做到的事。","pronunciation":["정복"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"72580","definition":"结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/d44c014a832d1d19f883.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75795-3-8-2","ko":"그래, 모르는 것 있으면 언제든 물어 봐.","zh":"没错，有不懂的地方随时都可以问。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래,","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모르는","meaning":"不会，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不会，不懂；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"2","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있으면","meaning":"处于，处在","explanation":"있다：处于，处在；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68796","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"언제든","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：什么时候；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；든：表示选择；与疑问词合用时可表示“无论、任何”。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물어","meaning":"掩藏，掩盖","explanation":"묻다：掩藏，掩盖；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"묻다","audio":"/audio/ed5c4f65f9f1771c348e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15722","senseId":"2","lemma":"묻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不会，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不具备某种知识、技能或技术。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"东西，事，的","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"泛指各种事物或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"处于，处在","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68796","definition":"人或动物继续保持某种状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不知道的某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"ed5c4f65f9f1771c","term":"묻다","zh":"掩藏，掩盖","audio":"/audio/ed5c4f65f9f1771c348e.mp3","entryId":"15722","definition":"将事情深藏起来。","pronunciation":["묻따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e2a16a9d6c86575840b8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.576,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=75795","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"고급","day":173,"sequenceScore":3.4027,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这次我一定要攻克英语会话的！","没错，有不懂的地方随时都可以问。","老兄，借我点钱吧。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这次我一定要攻克英语会话的！","没错，有不懂的地方随时都可以问。","老兄，借我点钱吧。"],"answer":1}]}
